# Local config (API keys)
# ConfigLocal.ets is tracked in git with placeholder values (api_id=0, api_hash='').
# Developers fill in their own credentials locally; do NOT commit real keys.
# To avoid accidentally committing real credentials:
#   git update-index --skip-worktree entry/src/main/ets/services/ConfigLocal.ets
# To undo:
#   git update-index --no-skip-worktree entry/src/main/ets/services/ConfigLocal.ets
# (hvigor breaks on dotted filenames, so Config.local.ets cannot be used)
